    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your units with Martial Ka’tah is picked to fight, choose a Ka’tah Stance for it. That Stance is active, and the unit holds its ability, only until the unit's attacks are all resolved. Dacatari Stance: the unit's models get [SUSTAINED HITS 1] on their melee weapons. Rendax Stance: the unit's models get [LETHAL HITS] on their melee weapons.",
